        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "18531_gutsugutsu_ex2",
      "japanese": "{鍋|なべ}がぐつぐつと{音|おと}を{立|た}てている。",
      "english": "The pot is making bubbling sounds.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "18531_gutsugutsu_ex3",
      "japanese": "カレーをぐつぐつと{弱火|よわび}で{煮込|にこ}んでいると、いい{香|かお}りがしてきた。",
      "english": "As I simmered the curry on low heat, a wonderful aroma wafted up.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
