  ],
  "notes": "An onomatopoeia for the sound of liquid simmering. Often used with と (ぐつぐつと) or directly before a verb (ぐつぐつ{煮|に}る). Compare with related cooking sounds: ぐらぐら (rolling boil, more vigorous), ことこと (gentle simmering, lighter sound), ふつふつ (just starting to bubble). ぐつぐつ suggests a moderate, steady simmer — not as gentle as ことこと but not as violent as ぐらぐら.",
